Scope of the fork
-----------------
  Notepad4-ML adds: multi-tab editing, match markers on the vertical
  scrollbar, an "open only in new window" option, "open in new window"
  (move semantics), and localized strings for 11 UI languages.
  All other behavior follows upstream Notepad4.

